      "writtenOn": "2024-01-09T05:06:00Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "But we are using a different variable from above vendor variant check, although they must have the same condition to be removed, I think. I think removing `BOARD_VNDK_VERSION` is the trigger to clean up the image version suffix. Can we use the same switch to the product variants as well? PLATFORM_VNDK_VERSION must not be a switch to remove the version suffix for the product variant, I think.",
      "parentUuid": "402096e0_379bf38b",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 127,
        "startChar": 2,
        "endLine": 127,
        "endChar": 51
      },
      "revId": "50eb502c1654330d87eb7e9e9b02d68f6bac0671",
